ubuntu-vnc
==========

Minimal Ubuntu desktop environment accessible via VNC in a web browser.

Requirements
------------

The following software must be installed on the host system:
* Docker
* Docker Compose

Quick Start
-----------

Build and start the container:

* docker compose up --build

Open the desktop in your browser:

* http://localhost:6080/vnc.html

Default Credentials
* username: ubuntu
* password: ubuntu
